# Normalize text files to LF in the repository. Without this, files saved with
# CRLF by Windows editors appear as fully-modified against the LF blobs stored
# in git, producing hundreds of phantom changes in `git status`.
* text=auto

# Explicit binary markers. Auto-detection handles these, but a misclassified
# binary would be corrupted by line-ending conversion, so be certain.
*.png      binary
*.pdf      binary
*.parquet  binary
*.keras    binary
*.lnk      binary
.DS_Store  binary
